### Memory Reset Recovery Pattern

```typescript
// First action after memory reset is ALWAYS context recovery
// 1. Read implementation progress
read_file("planning/[workflow-folder]/implementation-progress.md", should_read_entire_file=true)

// 2. Read current state documentation
list_dir("1000xbrain/knowledge/rules")
